document (under 100 words) for someone with little to no background knowledge. Use simple, everyday language. Keep all numbers, dates, percentages. Avoid jargon—explain technical terms simply. Use bullet points when relevant.","prompt-3":"Create up to 5 FAQs from this document: (max 2 sentences, factual).Use simple language. Focus on policies/processes/definitions—not trivia. Keep numbers, dates, percentages. Avoid jargon, grouping, duplicates.","prompt-4":"Define up to 5 key terms from the document with one-line definitions. Help readers grasp unfamiliar/critical terms without reading full document. Each definition: one line, context-specific.","prompt-5":"Extract key values (numbers, dates, percentages, KPIs). Stay within 100 words. Focus on critical numbers driving meaning. Use exact figures only—never guess.","prompt-6":"Create a 3-5 sentence abstract as a paragraph for quick understanding of the document's essence and structure. Use professional academic style. Summarize the objective, approach, and outcomes. Make it concise and reusable for submissions or citations.","kContract-prompt-1":"What risks does this agreement create for each party? Identify clauses that limit rights, impose penalties, or create unexpected liability — especially anything a signing party should reconsider. Skip standard boilerplate. Flag specifically what each party should watch out for before signing.","kContract-prompt-2":"What is each party required to do under this agreement? List all clearly stated obligations, including any deadlines, conditions, or requirements.","kContract-prompt-3":"Are there any terms in this agreement that are uncommon or more restrictive than what is typically expected in a similar contract? Highlight those clauses, explain what they mean, and why they may be surprising or worth additional attention.","kInstructions-prompt-1":"What do I need to do first to get this product or process working? Just the initial setup steps — unboxing, installation, first launch, basic configuration. Don't include advanced usage or troubleshooting. Only include what the guide explicitly describes.","kInstructions-prompt-2":"Simplify this manual into the core instructions: what to do, in order, without fiddly details. Drop exhaustive warnings, edge cases, and step variants. For someone who wants the gist of using this product, not the full procedure. Only include actions stated in the document.","kInstructions-prompt-3":"Generate FAQ-style Q&As from this manual: 5–8 common questions a user would ask about this product, each answered using only what the manual covers. Cover setup, normal use, settings, and limitations. If a likely question isn't addressed, say so.","kForm-prompt-1":"Help me understand any non-obvious fields in this form. Explain what they mean, what information is required, and where I can typically find that information. Only include fields that may need guidance.","kForm-prompt-2":"What is this form for, who needs to fill it out, and does it apply to me? Give a brief overview of its purpose, any important deadlines or submission requirements, and what happens after it is submitted. Focus on the essentials, not individual fields.","kForm-prompt-3":"What documents, attachments, or other forms do I need before I can submit this form? Create a checklist of everything I may need to gather or complete beforehand, and note any items that might require additional research or verification."},o={TRY_NOW:"TRY_NOW",OPT_IN_COMPLETE:"OPT_IN_COMPLETE"},s={ALL_TOOLS:"ModernViewerAllTools",RECENT_FILES_CONTEXT_MENU:"MoreMenu"},l="verb-doc-read-aloud",c=["fr","de","es","it","pt","ja"],d=Object.freeze({fr:"fr",de:"de",es:"es",it:"it",pt:"pt",ja:"jp"}),p=["fr","de","es","it","pt","ja"],u="https://www.adobe.com/legal/licenses-terms/adobe-gen-ai-user-guidelines.html",h="https://www.adobe.com/legal/terms.html",m="https://www.adobe.com/privacy.html",f="https://www.adobe.com/go/GenAIwebDataUsage",y={LEFT:"left",TOP:"top",CARD_MEDIUM_VERTICAL:"me